<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners net sellers of SAfrica shares last week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net sellers of SAfrica shares last week.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock Exchange (JSE) said non-residents were net sellers of 245.755 million rand worth of South African shares last week.</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand) -</p>
<p>			  Week to Jan 31     Year to date    Year ago</p>
<p>Equities:</p>
<p>- purchases		    818.724     3,963.844	 4,220.330</p>
<p>- sales			1,064.479     3,972.333	 3,377.829</p>
<p>- net purchases/(sales)  (245.755)	 (8.489)	   842.501</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures reflect only the portion of the market where non-resident transactions are executed through the JSE, and are therefore not comprehensive.</p>
<p>The JSE said it registered a record 42,467 deals on the exchange last week.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
